;I# 9002 : wolfling pack cloak
INUMBER 9002
NAME 52
MISC
WORN_BACK
VOLUME 8
WEIGHT 2
SUBSTANCE FUR
*DESCRIPTION_START
A dark gray fur cloak, heavy and warm, its collar and hem fringed with a
row of sharp werewolf teeth. Something about it stirs a restless, primal
energy just beneath the skin.
*DESCRIPTION_END
IFPREVERB CONCENTRATE -1
  IFITEM -1 WORN
    CLEARVERB
    ECHO PLAYER You focus your will into the cloak and let loose a long, echoing howl!
    ECHO OTHERS %N focuses %h will into %a and lets loose a long, echoing howl!
    CALLPACK
  ENDIF
ENDIF
IFPREVERB PULL -1
  IFITEM -1 WORN
    CLEARVERB
    ECHO OTHERS %n's cloak shifts color to match the surrounding area.
    ECHO PLAYER Your cloak shifts color to match the surrounding area, allowing you to conceal yourself with greater ease.
    SPELL 521 40
  ENDIF
ENDIF
IFPREVERB PUSH -1
  IFITEM -1 WORN
    CLEARVERB
    ECHO PLAYER You push the hood of your cloak back.
    ECHO OTHERS %N pushes the hood of %h cloak back.
  ENDIF
ENDIF
